  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "Children's disappointment mapped to college rejection",
  "description": "The visual depiction of two disappointed children is mapped onto the textual concept of 'not getting accepted to the same college'. The meme uses the children's expressions as a humorous contrast to suggest that their perceived sadness is trivial compared to the real-world stress of college rejection. This mapping relies on the juxtaposition of the visual material (disappointed children) with the textual material (college rejection) to create an analogy where the children represent the emotional state of someone who didn't get accepted to college.",
